// Screening: where being ALLOWED to call something is itself the sensitive part.
//
// Sanctions screening is the clearest case in this tree for compartments being
// separate from clearance. A senior engineer cleared to RESTRICTED still has no
// business here; a compliance analyst two grades below them does. Seniority is
// not need-to-know, and conflating the two is how a bank ends up with an
// investigation visible to everyone who happens to be important.
//
// The guidance on screen_party is not ergonomic advice. Tipping off a screened
// party is a criminal offence in several jurisdictions, and an agent relaying a
// match to the customer on the phone is exactly how that happens.

